@AttendanceSystem.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5155

### Save daily attendance
POST {{AttendanceSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/daily
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolId": 1,
  "attendDate": "2026-10-22",
  "submittedBy": "clerk",
  "students": [
    { "studentId": 1, "attendCode": "P", "minutesLate": 0, "notes": null }
  ]
}

###

GET {{AttendanceSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/students/1/history?schoolYear=2026-2027
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{AttendanceSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/students/3/chronic-absenteeism?schoolYear=2026-2027
Accept: application/json

